# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Hyperbolic World — an H²×ℝ block walker (Hypermine-flavoured)
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#
# You stand on the HYPERBOLIC PLANE (the Poincaré disk) with ordinary vertical
# gravity — the simplest cousin of Hypermine's H³ world ("H²×ℝ" geometry).
# Blocks tile the plane; because space is hyperbolic, ever more of them crowd
# toward the horizon (the disk boundary = infinity) and shrink as they go.
#
# Movement is by HYPERBOLIC TRANSLATION (Möbius transforms): you stay at the
# disk centre and the whole world slides under you. Walk in a "square" loop and
# you'll come back rotated — that's hyperbolic holonomy, the real thing.
#
# Controls:
#   W / S   walk forward / back        A / D   strafe left / right
#   Q / E   turn left / right          SPACE   jump (gravity pulls you back)
#
# Block "textures" are generated procedurally from each cell's lattice id
# (hash → block type → colour), shaded with the holographic cel renderer.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

令 R   = 8.0      # disk → ground-plane spread
令 ZC  = 9.0      # ground centre depth in front of camera
令 BS  = 0.9      # base block size at the disk centre
令 STEP = 0.035   # hyperbolic step per frame while moving
令 TURN = 0.03    # rotation per frame while turning
令 G    = 22.0    # gravity
令 JUMP = 7.5     # jump impulse

# ── fract(sin) hash → pseudo-random 0..1 ─────────────────────────────────────
函 hash01(a, b) {
    令 s = sin(a*12.9898 + b*78.233) * 43758.5453
    s - floor(s)
}

# ── main ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
bind start = do {
    open_fullscreen("Hyperbolic World — H²×ℝ walker")
    capture_mouse()
    set_ambient(0.22)
    set_shade_mode(2)
    set_cel_bands(4)
    set_shadow_color(24, 30, 74)
    set_rim(0.6, 120, 210, 255)

    ระดับเสียง(0.3)
    เสียงโทน(0, 0.0, 0.0, ZC, 6.0, 70.0, 0.05, 0.5, 0.02)

    # ── generate the hyperbolic block lattice (rings of growing count) ───────
    令 bu = list_new()       # block disk-u
    令 bv = list_new()       # block disk-v
    令 bt = list_new()       # block type 0..3
    令 bh = list_new()       # block height (in block units)

    令 ring = 1
    ขณะที่ ring <= 4 {
        令 er = ring / 5.0 * 0.92        # euclidean radius in the disk
        令 cells = 6 * ring               # more cells per outer ring → crowding
        令 k = 0
        ขณะที่ k < cells {
            令 ang = (k / cells) * 6.28318
            令 bu = list_push(bu, er * cos(ang))
            令 bv = list_push(bv, er * sin(ang))
            令 t  = floor(hash01(ring, k) * 4.0)
            令 bt = list_push(bt, t)
            令 bh = list_push(bh, 1.0 + floor(hash01(k, ring) * 3.0))
            令 k = k + 1
        }
        令 ring = ring + 1
    }
    # one block right under the player (home tile)
    令 bu = list_push(bu, 0.0)
    令 bv = list_push(bv, 0.0)
    令 bt = list_push(bt, 0.0)
    令 bh = list_push(bh, 1.0)

    令 n = len(bu)

    # player vertical state
    令 pyh = 0.0       # height above ground (up = -Y on screen)
    令 vy  = 0.0
    令 FR  = 0

    ขณะที่ หน้าต่างเปิดอยู่() {
        เติม(3, 4, 12)
        令 dt = 0.0166667

        # ── build this frame's movement as a disk translation + rotation ─────
        令 ax = 0.0
        令 ay = 0.0
        若 key_down("w") { 令 ay = ay - STEP }   # walk forward (world slides toward −v)
        若 key_down("s") { 令 ay = ay + STEP }
        若 key_down("a") { 令 ax = ax + STEP }   # strafe
        若 key_down("d") { 令 ax = ax - STEP }

        令 rot = 0.0
        若 key_down("q") { 令 rot = TURN }
        若 key_down("e") { 令 rot = 0.0 - TURN }
        令 cr = cos(rot)
        令 sr = sin(rot)

        # ── gravity + jump (vertical, Euclidean) ─────────────────────────────
        令 grounded = 0
        若 pyh < 0.001 { 令 grounded = 1 }
        若 key_down("space") {
            若 grounded > 0 { 令 vy = JUMP }
        }
        令 vy = vy - G * dt
        令 pyh = pyh + vy * dt
        若 pyh < 0.0 { 令 pyh = 0.0   令 vy = 0.0 }

        # ── lights swing overhead ────────────────────────────────────────────
        clear_lights()
        add_light(cos(FR*0.01)*5.0, 0.0-7.0, ZC,  1.0, 0.82, 0.6,  1.6, 0.0)
        add_light(0.0, 0.0-4.0, ZC-4.0,  0.47, 0.67, 1.0,  1.1, 0.0)

        # camera: at origin, tilted down to look across the hyperbolic ground
        set_camera(1.0, 0.0, 0.86, 0.51)   # pitch ~ look down
        set_zdist(1.4)

        # ── transform every block by the frame's translation + rotation, then
        #    draw it; rebuild the coordinate lists in place ─────────────────────
        令 nbu = list_new()
        令 nbv = list_new()
        令 i = 0
        ขณะที่ i < n {
            令 u = list_get(bu, i)
            令 v = list_get(bv, i)

            # hyperbolic translation (Möbius) inlined:  (z+a)/(1+ā z)
            令 nx = u + ax
            令 ny = v + ay
            令 qx = 1.0 + ax*u + ay*v
            令 qy = ax*v - ay*u
            令 den = qx*qx + qy*qy
            令 mu = (nx*qx + ny*qy) / den
            令 mv = (ny*qx - nx*qy) / den
            # then rotation about the centre
            令 u2 = mu*cr - mv*sr
            令 v2 = mu*sr + mv*cr

            令 nbu = list_push(nbu, u2)
            令 nbv = list_push(nbv, v2)

            # conformal factor: blocks shrink toward the boundary (=infinity)
            令 rr = u2*u2 + v2*v2
            若 rr < 0.965 {
                令 conf = 1.0 - rr
                令 size = BS * conf
                令 wx = u2 * R
                令 wz = ZC + v2 * R
                令 ht = list_get(bh, i) * size

                # procedural "texture" → colour by block type (0..3)
                令 ty = list_get(bt, i)
                set_color(120, 220, 255)              # crystal (default / type 3)
                若 ty < 0.5 { set_color(90, 200, 90) }    # grass
                若 ty > 0.5 { 若 ty < 1.5 { set_color(150, 150, 165) } }  # stone
                若 ty > 1.5 { 若 ty < 2.5 { set_color(155, 110, 70) } }   # dirt

                # block sits on the ground (y=0), rising "up" (−Y); jump lifts world
                令 cyc = 0.0 - ht + pyh
                cube(wx, cyc, wz,  size, ht, size,  0.0, 0.0, 0.0,  0)
            }

            令 i = i + 1
        }
        令 bu = nbu
        令 bv = nbv

        # ── you: a small avatar capsule at the disk centre ───────────────────
        set_color(255, 240, 180)
        令 ph = 0.0 - 0.7 + pyh
        capsule(0.0, ph, ZC,  0.28, 0.5, 0.28,  0.0, 0.0, 0.0,  2,  10, 4)

        แสดงผล()
        令 FR = FR + 1
    }
}
